# Runtime and sensitive outputs only.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately (tech-spec §3, developer-guide §1):
#   packages/contracts/generated/**   — generated contract types are committed
#   pnpm-lock.yaml, uv.lock           — both lockfiles are committed and frozen
# `build:contracts --check` and the pinned-local render proof are only reproducible
# because those trees are tracked. Do not add them here.

# Real job state: client footage, rights-sensitive media (tech-spec §9.1)
project-data/

# Secrets: model API keys (developer-guide §2)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output and caches
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
node_modules/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Local scratch
*.local
